---
title: dinyd · project runtime and host bindings
config:
  look: handDrawn
  handDrawnSeed: 5
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    mainBkg: "#333333"
    clusterBkg: "#242424"
  themeCSS: |
    small { display: inline-block; text-align: left; }
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 270
---
%% Behavior authority: installation.md.
flowchart LR
  Init["init<br/><small>selected version</small>"]
  Global@{ shape: fr-rect, label: "dinyd on PATH<br/><small>select the project's runtime</small>" }
  Runtime@{ shape: fr-rect, label: "selected dinyd<br/><small>same binary · pinned behavior</small>" }
  Host@{ shape: fr-rect, label: "agent host" }

  subgraph Project["project · worktree"]
    Pin@{ shape: doc, label: "version pin" }
    Bindings@{ shape: docs, label: "host bindings" }
  end

  Init -->|keep or explicitly change| Pin
  Init -->|matching templates| Bindings
  Pin -->|read by| Global
  Bindings -->|loaded by| Host
  Host -->|guard payload · project context| Global
  Global -->|run or delegate| Runtime

  classDef em fill:#173d25,stroke:#86efac
  classDef file fill:#3d3415,stroke:#fcd34d
  class Init em
  class Pin,Bindings file
